        "title": "Why leading yacht designers specify Monteiro marine fabrics",
        "title_size": 28,
        "title_width": 16,
        "text": "<p>Monteiro has manufactured coated fabrics in Porto, Portugal since 1917 — four generations of technical expertise in PVC coating, calendering, and finishing.</p><p>Proven in luxury hospitality (<a href=\"/blogs/news/savoy-palace-nini-andrade-silva\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Savoy Palace, Nini Andrade Silva\">Vila Foz Hotel</a>, <a href=\"/blogs/news/savoy-palace-nini-andrade-silva\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Savoy Palace, Nini Andrade Silva\">Savoy Palace</a>) where durability and aesthetics face equal scrutiny — marine interiors demand the same balance.</p><p>Unlike commodity suppliers, Monteiro offers manufacturer-direct service: custom colour matching, tailormade development, 1-piece minimums, and guaranteed 48-hour dispatch from stock.</p><p>55+ years of PVC coating expertise means every metre is engineered for UV resistance, salt spray durability, mildew prevention, and sustained colour stability.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/fabrics-by-industry",
