      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "From superyacht salons to workboat cabins — built for every marine application",
        "title": "Applications and use cases",
        "title_size": 48,
        "title_width": 12,
        "heading_h1": false,
        "text": "<ul><li><strong>Luxury yachts and superyachts</strong>: Salon seating, cabin headboards, wall panels, ceiling linings. Colour-matched to interior design schemes with 228+ shades available. Proven luxury credentials from five-star hospitality projects.</li><li><strong>Sailboats and cruisers</strong>: Cockpit cushions, cabin upholstery, nav station surfaces. UV stability and mildew resistance for long passages. Easy cleaning with mild detergent.</li><li><strong>Commercial vessels</strong>: Crew seating, passenger cabins, public area furnishing. Fire-retardant options available. High-cycle abrasion resistance for heavy traffic.</li><li><strong>Leisure and pontoon boats</strong>: Helm seating, sun pad upholstery, console wraps. Waterproof, stain-resistant, quick-drying performance.</li><li><strong>Yacht refit projects</strong>: Ideal for refurbishment — available from stock in 48 hours, 1-piece minimum orders, custom colour matching for heritage vessel restorations.</li></ul>",
        "image_width": 120,
