      "settings": {
        "subheading": "ISO certified, independently tested, backed by the industry's longest warranty",
        "title": "Certifications and quality assurance",
        "title_size": 48,
        "title_width": 12,
        "heading_h1": false,
        "text": "<ul><li><strong>ISO 9001:2015</strong> — Quality management system certification ensures consistent manufacturing standards across every production run.</li><li><strong>ISO 14001:2015</strong> — Environmental management certification confirms Monteiro's commitment to sustainable manufacturing practices.</li><li><strong>REACH Compliance</strong> — (EC) No 1907/2006. All fabrics comply with EU chemical safety regulations.</li><li><strong>10-Year Warranty</strong> — The longest guarantee in the marine coated fabric industry. Every Monteiro fabric is warranted against manufacturing defects for a full decade.</li><li>Independent third-party testing for UV resistance, abrasion, colour fastness, and hydrolysis.</li></ul>",
